=== REPLAY DECISION TRACE LOG ===
Event Type Definitions:
- CROSS_UP: Price opens below/on and closes above the line
- CROSS_DOWN: Price opens above/on and closes below the line
- SUPPORT_TEST: Candle opens and closes above line, but low wick touches/pierces line
- RESISTANCE_TEST: Candle opens and closes below line, but high wick touches/pierces line
- BREACH_CONFIRMED: Price closes beyond the more extreme of (BEC close OR ZEC extreme). For multi-line crosses, all except furthest line get immediate intrabar confirmation.
  UP: max(BEC_close, ZEC_high). DOWN: min(BEC_close, ZEC_low)
- SUPPORT_BOUNCE: Price bounces up by threshold % after a SUPPORT_TEST
- RESISTANCE_REJECTION: Price rejects down by threshold % after a RESISTANCE_TEST
- TARGET_HIT: First contact with an angle line in the target progression sequence. Only fires once per line; subsequent contacts are ignored.
